    Journal "You are sinful. You need to get punished by [Guard] Cabal."
    Kill 50 of 9318 at direction_1073
    Kill 50 of 9319 at direction_1074
    Kill 50 of 9320 at direction_1075
    Kill 50 of 9321 at direction_1076

Requires player level >= 1 and quest 822 is completed

Rewards none

direction_1073 = location "Werewolf" about "Werewolf\nCursed people from Pathos' War who inherited the evil blood and transformed to Werewolves." found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92
direction_1074 = location "Silan" about "Silan\nBulkan type monster with strong vitality and their bones can be used to craft armors." found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92
direction_1075 = location "Gloomwing" about "Gloomwing\nBird type monster which transformed by Pathos' evil power." found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92
direction_1076 = location "Scorpion" about "Scorpion\nThe poison in its tail is dangerous but also used for herbicide." found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92

On offer
    Say "You have been brought to the jail for using [Hack Tool]. You can go back to Moradon when you have completed the punishments here."
    Topic "Confirm" do
        Show quest "Follow [Guard] Cabal's order and catch  [Werewolf], [Cylan], [Gloomwing], [Scorpion]."

On in_progress
    Say "Please thoroughly complete the mission to leave the jail."

On completed
    Say "Mission completed. If you even come back here again, you will get harsher punishment. Keep in mind and try not to come back here ever again."
    Topic "Oh, right." do
        Teleport 21 at 817 448
